# Ride booking — OpenStreetMap + OpenRouteService
# Local: copy to .env.local, set your key, restart `npm run dev`
# Vercel (live site): Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add the key
#   for Production + Preview, then Redeploy.

# Prefer the server-only name on Vercel (not exposed to the browser):
OPENROUTESERVICE_API_KEY=

# Optional local alias (also supported by the fare directions API):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OPENROUTESERVICE_API_KEY=
